            formalityVariants: { casual: 'First time at a laundromat. Quarters or cards?', standard: 'Hi, I\'ve never used a laundromat before. Do these machines take quarters or cards?', formal: 'Good afternoon. This is my first visit to a laundromat. Could you tell me whether these machines accept coins or card payments?' },
