            formalityVariants: { casual: 'Sending this to China. Fastest option? Customs form needed?', standard: 'I need to send this package to China. What\'s the fastest option and do I need to fill out a customs form?', formal: 'I would like to ship this package to China. Could you advise on the fastest available service and whether a customs declaration form is required?' },
