            formalityVariants: { casual: 'Birthday gift — clothes and a book, 80 bucks. What goes on the form?', standard: 'It\'s a birthday gift — some clothes and a book, worth about $80 total. How do I describe that on the form?', formal: 'The contents are a birthday gift consisting of clothing and a book, with an approximate total value of $80. How should I describe these items on the customs declaration?' },
